#: src/scenes/ui/game_end_window.gd
msgid "Selvisit kauden loppuun, ja kellarisi kaljasta tuli kaupunginosan legenda."
msgstr ""
"You made it to the end of the season, and your cellar beer became the stuff "
"of neighbourhood legend."

#: src/scenes/ui/game_end_window.gd
msgid "Selvisit kauden loppuun, mutta legendaksi tarvitaan %d mainetta."
msgstr ""
"You made it to the end of the season, but becoming a legend takes %d "
